# Unified Service Scheduler - walkthrough requests (Visual Studio, Rider, VS Code REST Client).
# Start the API first (http://localhost:5080).
# @day is an example date: pick any FUTURE date (the README responses were captured with 2026-11-10).
# Requests 4-13 follow the README walkthrough; run them in order.
# The Idempotency-Keys contain @day, so a run with another date never collides with an earlier run.

@api = http://localhost:5080
@day = 2026-11-10

### 1. Dealerships
GET {{api}}/api/dealerships

### 2. Service types of dealership 1
GET {{api}}/api/service-types?dealershipId=1

### 3. Free start times for a brake inspection (90 min)
GET {{api}}/api/dealerships/1/availability?serviceTypeId=2&date={{day}}

### 4. Book 13:00 local -> 201 Created (Location: /api/appointments/{id})
# @name book
POST {{api}}/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-{{day}}-1

{ "customerId": 1, "vehicleId": 1, "dealershipId": 1, "serviceTypeId": 2, "startTime": "{{day}}T13:00:00+07:00" }

### 5. Same key + same body again -> the same 201 response, no second booking
POST {{api}}/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-{{day}}-1

{ "customerId": 1, "vehicleId": 1, "dealershipId": 1, "serviceTypeId": 2, "startTime": "{{day}}T13:00:00+07:00" }

### 6. Same slot, another car, new key -> 409 NO_AVAILABILITY with suggestedStartTimes
POST {{api}}/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-{{day}}-2

{ "customerId": 1, "vehicleId": 2, "dealershipId": 1, "serviceTypeId": 2, "startTime": "{{day}}T13:00:00+07:00" }

### 6b. Same car at another dealership at the same time -> 409 VEHICLE_ALREADY_BOOKED
POST {{api}}/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-{{day}}-vehicle

{ "customerId": 1, "vehicleId": 1, "dealershipId": 2, "serviceTypeId": 5, "startTime": "{{day}}T13:00:00+07:00" }

### 7. Same key, different body -> 409 IDEMPOTENCY_CONFLICT
POST {{api}}/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-{{day}}-1

{ "customerId": 1, "vehicleId": 1, "dealershipId": 1, "serviceTypeId": 2, "startTime": "{{day}}T14:00:00+07:00" }

### 8. Ends after closing time (16:00 + 90 min) -> 422 BOOKING_RULE_VIOLATION
POST {{api}}/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-{{day}}-3

{ "customerId": 1, "vehicleId": 2, "dealershipId": 1, "serviceTypeId": 2, "startTime": "{{day}}T16:00:00+07:00" }

### 9. Not on the 15-minute grid -> 400 INVALID_REQUEST
POST {{api}}/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-{{day}}-4

{ "customerId": 1, "vehicleId": 2, "dealershipId": 1, "serviceTypeId": 2, "startTime": "{{day}}T10:10:00+07:00" }

### 10. Cancel the booking from step 4 -> 200 Cancelled (only before it starts)
POST {{api}}/api/appointments/{{book.response.body.$.id}}/cancel

### 11. Cancel again -> 409 APPOINTMENT_NOT_CANCELLABLE
POST {{api}}/api/appointments/{{book.response.body.$.id}}/cancel

### 12. Rebook the freed slot with a new key -> 201 Created
POST {{api}}/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-{{day}}-5

{ "customerId": 1, "vehicleId": 1, "dealershipId": 1, "serviceTypeId": 2, "startTime": "{{day}}T13:00:00+07:00" }

### 13. My appointments, newest first
GET {{api}}/api/appointments?customerId=1

### 14. Health
GET {{api}}/health/ready
